:: Lucas Hang Out Park Sit & Chat [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> sit down on a nearby bench to take a minute to catch your breath. You turn to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and notice him sitting there a little awkwardly, swinging his legs and tapping his knees to try and fill the silence. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sooo…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> says, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Did you want to chat about anything?”</span> You chuckle and try to think of a topic to talk about. <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Lucas",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Happy",
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Happy",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

What do you want to ask him about?<br>
<br>

