        <<if _random == 1>>
            Curious, you ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> if he’s ever gotten detention and his immediate blush quickly cues you in and you laugh. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What? Who hasn’t!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> responds with mild embarrassment. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We’ve all done some things we shouldn’t, especially when we-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> pauses, trailing off, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m just happy I haven’t gotten detention from <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Randolph</span> yet. I don’t think my butt could take that.”</span> You both laugh and spend some time talking about your experiences in detention. <br>
