                You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> if you can ask him a personal question and he turns to you, looking a bit worried, and nods. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Of course, like I said before, I’ll tell you anything.”</span> Perfect.  <span style="Color: Pink">You were wondering if there were any other times he got locked outside naked. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wha- what!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> turns red at the lewdness of the question.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s not what I was talking about you pervert!”</span> You laugh, he already said he’d tell you anything. So, if he doesn’t answer, he’s a liar and not a true friend. <br>
