                You are kidding, obviously, and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> can tell.  <span style="Color: Pink">Though you get the idea he may enjoy the idea of sharing embarrassing stories with you.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fine! But you can’t tell anyone about this, alright?”</span> You nod, eagerly waiting the story. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> ensures no one is within earshot before starting. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It was back when I was with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span>…”</span> He pauses briefly, still a little weird on talking about him, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We went camping in the woods with his dad back when we were like 8. It was fun, we did a bunch of stuff. We shared a tent and sleeping bag, since it was easier. Well, I woke up without any clothes on, not even underwear. Turns out <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span> thought it would be funny to hide my stuff, said he wouldn’t tell me where until we left the next day. So, I was stuck out in the woods without any clothes on.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> laughs,  <span style="Color: Pink">his tone and smile making you realize just how much he cherishes these memories.</span> <br>
