                <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Of course, I was super embarrassed and wouldn’t come out of the tent until he dragged me out. We still had another night there and the thought of not having anything to wear all day was too much, I started crying.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>  <span style="Color: Pink">blushes a little, embarrassed about his childish response.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Of course, his dad heard this and came out and started yelling at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span>. Gave him the choice of getting his butt beat right there or giving up his clothes as well. Long story short, we both had to go hiking and fishing butt naked. Was super embarrassing, but thankfully nobody saw us. Plus, we were both embarrassed together, so it wasn’t so bad. Though sharing a sleeping bag was a little awkward that night. That was actually the first night we…”</span> <span style="Color: Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> pauses, suddenly remember where he was.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So- sorry! Ye- yeah. That was pretty embarrassing, I guess.”</span> You give <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> a hug, claiming you’d share a nude sleeping bag with him anytime. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Shut up.”</span> He laughs. <br>
